WEBVTT

00:13.240 --> 00:15.950
Hurry, hurry!

00:16.990 --> 00:19.990
I'm so glad you finally recover.

00:24.290 --> 00:27.580
They are good, you'll see.

00:28.200 --> 00:32.010
It won't take you long to adapt.

00:39.120 --> 00:39.870
Yes...

00:51.860 --> 00:53.530
Ok, listen up.

00:54.610 --> 01:01.030
As announced, Nishiyama-san, who has been absent since the beginning of school, is coming to school today!

01:01.380 --> 01:04.290
Therefore, let's have her introduce herself!

01:04.970 --> 01:06.920
Hey, Mittan...

01:07.040 --> 01:09.320
There's no one there.

01:11.300 --> 01:11.930
Huh!?

01:12.810 --> 01:17.670
Ehh...? Nishiyama-san!? Where did you go?

01:22.130 --> 01:25.850
<i>I'm Nishiyama Hiyori, 15 years old.</i>

01:26.170 --> 01:28.480
<i>And I'm extremely shy!</i>

01:29.020 --> 01:30.480
Nishiyama-san!

01:34.140 --> 01:34.980
Oh!

01:42.110 --> 01:43.090
Hiyori!

01:43.210 --> 01:46.500
Please, go ahead.

01:46.500 --> 01:49.250
Uhm... well...

01:49.370 --> 01:50.250
Wow!

01:50.370 --> 01:51.180
Cool!

01:51.300 --> 01:52.780
She's so tiny!

01:52.780 --> 01:54.000
So cute!

01:54.210 --> 01:59.680
<i>Things like introductions are... what I dislike most in life!</i>

02:01.070 --> 02:03.350
<i>But now that I'm here...</i>

02:04.810 --> 02:07.560
<i>I should at least say my name!</i>

02:08.800 --> 02:09.470
Ni...

02:10.180 --> 02:11.890
Nishiyama Hiyo...

02:14.040 --> 02:15.940
Mornin'!

02:16.360 --> 02:19.040
Hey, hey, what's funny?

02:18.660 --> 02:20.870
You're late, Yuushin!

02:21.500 --> 02:24.460
Late again, Hirose-kun?

02:24.580 --> 02:27.760
Nishiyama-san is introducing herself right now.

02:27.880 --> 02:29.540
<i>I've been interrupted...</i>

02:29.660 --> 02:31.250
Nishiyama?

02:38.440 --> 02:40.440
<i>Who is this person?</i>

02:47.010 --> 02:48.200
Aren't you...

02:50.000 --> 02:51.650
a bit small?

02:52.530 --> 02:54.730
The difference in height is amazing!

02:55.270 --> 02:56.720
Wow!

03:01.000 --> 03:03.280
Ri-ccha-an!

03:04.070 --> 03:07.370
I'm so glad that Ricchan is in the same class!

03:07.860 --> 03:11.250
Take it easy. Aren't you happy you didn't have to repeat a year?

03:11.250 --> 03:12.120
Yeah.

03:12.120 --> 03:14.750
You sure are unlucky, though.

03:15.120 --> 03:19.090
The day before the school ceremony, you hit a truck...

03:19.090 --> 03:21.760
resulting in complicated bone fractures all over your body.

03:23.330 --> 03:29.020
If I was run over, I wouldn't have been here right now, so I might have been lucky, after all.

03:29.210 --> 03:33.020
How are your studies? It's been twelve months...

03:33.300 --> 03:36.310
It's fine. I had the teacher help me out.

03:36.310 --> 03:39.530
I was discharged from the hospital for a few days, as well, to take exams.

03:41.240 --> 03:46.450
<i>Speaking of being unlucky... This guy next to me...</i>

03:47.870 --> 03:49.700
What's wrong, Yuushin?

03:49.970 --> 03:55.380
Nothing. I'm just amazed that this micro-sized girl's a senior high school student.

03:56.450 --> 03:58.260
You're just really tall.

03:58.380 --> 04:04.550
Anyway, I've been wondering what Nishiyama-san reminds me of...

04:04.990 --> 04:06.180
What could it be?

04:09.500 --> 04:12.810
Does Hiyori remind you of some performer?

04:13.040 --> 04:13.870
Hiyo...?

04:14.760 --> 04:17.560
hiyoko = chick

04:14.980 --> 04:17.560
Ah, Hiyoko!!

04:17.830 --> 04:19.670
"Hi-yo-ko"?

04:21.640 --> 04:24.070
Y'know, all fluffy and stuff!

04:24.910 --> 04:26.530
For real.

04:28.150 --> 04:29.990
I want to pet her.

04:29.990 --> 04:31.500
Stop it...

04:31.500 --> 04:33.160
Yuushin's a pervert!

04:33.160 --> 04:35.750
Nishiyama-san, hide!

04:36.730 --> 04:37.960
I...

04:38.850 --> 04:44.510
I... Nishiyama Hiyori...

04:46.750 --> 04:49.800
<i>God, please save me from this rude person!</i>

04:51.850 --> 04:56.810
<i>It's difficult enough for me to start study from mid-year, and now he is...</i>

04:57.760 --> 04:58.860
Stand up!

05:01.680 --> 05:04.650
What is it, reverse "Lovely Complex"?

05:04.650 --> 05:06.280
She sure is small.

05:06.280 --> 05:07.910
He sure is tall.

05:07.910 --> 05:09.660
Difference is a whole halfmeter.

05:09.890 --> 05:13.580
<i>Because of him I get extra attention!</i>

05:16.800 --> 05:21.240
<i>He sleeps all through class and snores loudly!</i>

05:23.400 --> 05:26.680
<i>And when I finally think he's getting up to follow class properly...</i>

05:31.190 --> 05:34.140
<i>This is the first time I've seen someone eat during class!</i>

05:34.260 --> 05:35.890
<i>And so fast, too.</i>

05:37.790 --> 05:39.350
You've seen me...

05:44.970 --> 05:46.610
Here, now you're an accomplice.

05:47.730 --> 05:49.350
Want some as well, Tanaka-kun?

05:54.190 --> 05:57.620
Teacher! Hirose-kun and Nishiyama-san are eating in class.

05:57.620 --> 05:59.540
Tanaka, you bastard!

06:00.340 --> 06:01.500
Nishiyama!

06:02.160 --> 06:04.670
Are you in that kind of relationship?

06:04.970 --> 06:06.340
That's not it!

06:06.340 --> 06:08.380
Stop it... Can't you see you're making her blush?

06:09.680 --> 06:11.260
On her first day...

06:11.790 --> 06:14.600
Way to go, Nishiyama-san!

06:14.720 --> 06:17.520
<i>What's with this guy!?</i>

06:17.640 --> 06:23.940
<i>Even though I want a quiet life... don't want to stand out...</i>

06:24.650 --> 06:26.360
Cafeteria

06:25.760 --> 06:27.440
Eh? What's so bad about it?

06:27.780 --> 06:29.900
Yuushin's popular, you know...

06:30.510 --> 06:31.630
and a good guy.

06:31.750 --> 06:36.580
But him just being there, people gather round his seat...

06:36.700 --> 06:37.380
And?

06:37.840 --> 06:42.420
...and then speak to me, too!

06:43.520 --> 06:46.940
Hey, Hiyori, you're so cute!

06:46.970 --> 06:48.090
What's your height?‎

06:48.090 --> 06:49.800
What are you chatting about with Yuushin?

06:54.650 --> 06:57.250
You should just get along with everyone.

06:59.680 --> 07:03.190
Hiyori! This is your chance to get over your shyness!

07:03.590 --> 07:07.740
We've been together since kindergarten...

07:07.860 --> 07:13.160
but eventually we'll have to apart. What will you do then, Hiyori?

07:13.890 --> 07:15.620
Ricchan...

07:15.740 --> 07:18.820
I don't want to apart...

07:18.870 --> 07:22.330
It's still a "what if" story, so don't cry.

07:23.110 --> 07:27.090
Besides, you could stumble across someone you like.

07:27.400 --> 07:31.670
If you're scared of making friends, then how are you going to get into a relationship?

07:32.310 --> 07:36.490
It's okay, Yuushin can get along with anybody.

07:37.220 --> 07:40.890
If you get along with him, I think you can get some more friends.

07:44.500 --> 07:45.810
<i>Get along...</i>

07:50.930 --> 07:52.750
Welcome back, Hiyorin.

07:53.970 --> 07:54.990
"Hiyorin"?

07:54.990 --> 07:57.710
I've decided to call you Hiyorin. Cute, right?

07:57.730 --> 08:00.450
Hiyo, say something.

08:02.160 --> 08:03.470
But what should I say?

08:07.340 --> 08:08.250
Ehm...

08:11.240 --> 08:14.550
<i>I can't talk well when I get nervous.</i>

08:14.670 --> 08:16.050
Take it easy!

08:22.740 --> 08:25.940
<i>I wonder if we can get along...</i>

08:27.240 --> 08:28.410
Nishiyama-san.

08:31.230 --> 08:32.070
Yes!

08:33.070 --> 08:35.200
Why so loud?

08:35.860 --> 08:38.870
Here. Mittan told me to give this to you.

08:42.580 --> 08:45.230
You're frightening her, Natsuki.

08:44.830 --> 08:47.330
Shut up!

08:47.450 --> 08:50.000
<i>I forgot to say "thank you"...</i>

08:58.280 --> 09:01.850
<i>There are always people around Hirose-kun.</i>

09:02.430 --> 09:06.060
<i>He's radiant and always smiling.</i>

09:08.350 --> 09:11.970
<i>He seems... so far away... to me.</i>

09:20.780 --> 09:23.200
Hiyorin, you don't have your textbook?

09:24.950 --> 09:27.500
Jeez, you should say so sooner!

09:27.960 --> 09:30.590
Not that I have one with me.

09:31.750 --> 09:33.550
Literature

09:32.370 --> 09:36.720
Hiyorin! Tanaka-kun's a really good guy.

09:37.300 --> 09:38.890
I don't mind to share.

09:39.250 --> 09:41.430
<i>I'm so sorry, Tanaka-kun!</i>

09:47.240 --> 09:50.560
<i>Too close... I can't even breathe.</i>

10:03.740 --> 10:09.160
Hey, Takashi! Are you asleep? Keep reading!

10:09.220 --> 10:11.790
From the next paragraph.

10:13.220 --> 10:15.130
I can draw Doraemon, too.

10:16.730 --> 10:17.800
See?

10:18.510 --> 10:20.890
That doesn't look right at all!

10:21.130 --> 10:23.180
You there, stop flirting!

10:23.390 --> 10:25.930
Teacher, stop being so jealous!

10:26.990 --> 10:28.890
<i>H-He's wrong...</i>

10:29.280 --> 10:31.600
So, you can laugh when you're with me, too.

10:33.020 --> 10:36.030
I thought you could only laugh around Ri-chan.

10:36.150 --> 10:37.790
I'm glad.

10:38.100 --> 10:41.110
<i>He's very observant...</i>

10:42.120 --> 10:47.370
For starters, Hiyorin, smile bringing you luck.

10:47.700 --> 10:49.650
That's my theory.

10:51.280 --> 10:52.250
Hirose!

10:52.250 --> 10:53.180
Here!

11:00.910 --> 11:05.260
Please comment on the end of your first day.

11:07.350 --> 11:11.270
Tired? Don't worry; tomorrow will surely be more fun!

11:11.590 --> 11:13.940
Ritsuka, we'll be late!

11:13.940 --> 11:15.310
Coming!

11:16.010 --> 11:19.920
I gotta go. I'm sorry we can't walk home together.

11:20.040 --> 11:22.820
It's okay. Do your best in your club.

11:22.940 --> 11:23.950
Thanks!

11:27.940 --> 11:30.250
Hiyori, you're going to go to school tomorrow, right?

11:31.540 --> 11:32.250
Yup.

11:33.450 --> 11:34.500
Take care.

11:34.870 --> 11:36.000
Bye bye!

11:45.990 --> 11:47.810
Ah, Hiyorin, bye bye!

11:47.810 --> 11:49.060
Later!

11:51.980 --> 11:55.350
<i>They remembered my name in just one day.</i>

11:55.620 --> 11:57.650
<i>Well, Hiyorin...</i>

11:58.830 --> 12:02.530
<i>If you get along with him, I think you can get some more friends.</i>

12:04.370 --> 12:09.200
<i>At the beginning I just thought he was loud and rude...</i>

12:27.870 --> 12:29.140
Yuushin's theory.

12:42.750 --> 12:44.830
Come on.

12:44.950 --> 12:45.990
Yeah.

12:46.110 --> 12:47.240
<i>Bye bye...</i>

13:03.430 --> 13:04.800
<i>See you tomorrow.</i>

13:19.270 --> 13:21.520
On duty

13:19.270 --> 13:21.520
Nishiyama

13:19.270 --> 13:21.520
Hirose

13:22.210 --> 13:25.070
<i>I'm on cleaning duty with Hirose-kun today.</i>

13:29.870 --> 13:32.620
Nishiyama-san is a kind of silent.

13:32.810 --> 13:33.590
Cute.

13:34.380 --> 13:37.580
You're really love cute little things, eh?

13:39.880 --> 13:42.380
She's incredibly small.

13:44.360 --> 13:46.260
Hiyori, morning!

13:46.560 --> 13:47.880
Good morning, Ricchan.

13:47.920 --> 13:51.430
What's this? You sure seem happy this morning.

13:51.430 --> 13:53.140
R-Really?

13:53.670 --> 13:54.630
Yo.

13:54.750 --> 13:57.100
Ah, Yuushin, good moring.

13:59.560 --> 14:01.150
G-Good mo...

13:59.570 --> 14:02.360
Yuushin, look a this.

14:03.830 --> 14:05.100
Stupid, right?

14:05.220 --> 14:07.030
Indeed.

14:07.950 --> 14:08.760
Hiyori?

14:09.280 --> 14:13.870
Ah, you two are on duty today! This will be a great chance for a conversation.

14:15.790 --> 14:16.500
Yup.

14:22.750 --> 14:24.830
He fell asleep sooner than usual today.

14:24.840 --> 14:26.960
Hey, it's 4th period already.

14:26.920 --> 14:31.260
Class Journal

14:27.630 --> 14:30.010
I'll just write in the class journal.

14:29.760 --> 14:31.190
Oh, he woke up.

14:33.890 --> 14:35.890
Yuushin, you sleep too much!

14:38.230 --> 14:41.730
The blackboard hasn't been wiped clean.

14:41.980 --> 14:43.730
Who's on duty today?

14:43.730 --> 14:45.730
Ah, I'm sorry!

14:45.850 --> 14:47.030
You're on duty?

14:51.240 --> 14:53.030
Do you best, Hiyorin!

14:58.170 --> 15:05.500
<i>Why can't I just say "we both have duty today" and have it over with?</i>

15:05.500 --> 15:06.550
Hiyorin!

15:07.000 --> 15:09.260
Your panties are showing!

15:24.780 --> 15:26.360
Chick?

15:27.150 --> 15:28.530
So cute!

15:28.950 --> 15:33.450
I-I'm wearing them too! They sure are warm, aren't they?

15:35.930 --> 15:37.490
Hey, Yuushin!

15:38.100 --> 15:41.650
H-Hiyorin wearing a Hiyoko's print is just too much!

15:38.100 --> 15:41.650
hiyoko = chick

15:45.070 --> 15:46.250
Oh shoot.

15:49.640 --> 15:51.920
Yuushin, aren't you on duty as well!?

15:53.220 --> 15:54.060
Hiyori!

16:17.760 --> 16:21.290
Hiyorin, come out of there. Everyone's looking for you.

16:27.350 --> 16:30.890
I shouldn't have come to school...

16:34.950 --> 16:42.350
I'm not like you. I'm not someone who can easily laugh at everything.

16:45.450 --> 16:46.900
Don't say that!

16:48.880 --> 16:51.110
What's this "I shouldn't have come" crap!?

16:52.940 --> 16:56.360
I finally have... someone sitting next to me.

16:59.780 --> 17:02.700
I'm always in that seat...

17:03.120 --> 17:05.420
so I don't block everyone's view.

17:08.230 --> 17:12.630
You should've told me that I was on duty...

17:13.920 --> 17:15.920
You were over there!?

17:19.000 --> 17:25.220
You know... My injuries healed a long time ago...

17:25.450 --> 17:34.860
But... as time passed... I became more and more scared of entering the classroom...

17:43.260 --> 17:45.200
Which do you think is scarier...

17:46.120 --> 17:48.370
"It's scary because I don't know"...

17:48.720 --> 17:52.420
or "It's scary because I do know"?

17:57.130 --> 18:00.140
If you think it's scary because you don't know, then you should just find out.

18:01.770 --> 18:02.870
Easy, right?

18:08.780 --> 18:09.470
Yup.

18:13.500 --> 18:18.570
<i>From the beginning... the one who put up a wall was me.</i>

18:20.530 --> 18:21.510
Hiyori!

18:27.480 --> 18:28.250
Ricchan?

18:28.250 --> 18:30.250
Jeez, where did you go?

18:30.250 --> 18:31.790
Sorry, Ricchan.

18:32.750 --> 18:37.460
You should just beat up all the boys who laughed at you; especially Yuushin.

18:38.180 --> 18:39.110
There she is!

18:39.120 --> 18:39.740
Hiyorin!

18:39.750 --> 18:40.700
Hiyori!

18:41.670 --> 18:43.970
Okay, we go back now?

18:44.360 --> 18:47.530
It seems like such a waste to go back into the classroom...

18:55.640 --> 18:57.860
I mean, just look outside.

19:13.140 --> 19:14.010
Hiyorin!

19:16.530 --> 19:18.420
Hiyori, are you ok?

19:19.080 --> 19:21.220
Whoops, did I aim too well?

19:21.490 --> 19:22.550
Natsuki...

19:22.850 --> 19:24.300
Are you nuts or what?

19:31.500 --> 19:32.810
Cold!

19:33.730 --> 19:35.690
<i>This is the first time I skipped class,</i>

19:36.610 --> 19:39.230
<i>laughed and talked so much.</i>

19:44.350 --> 19:45.950
<i>And the first time...</i>

19:48.010 --> 19:50.950
<i>that my heart wants to get closer to a special someone.</i>

19:57.080 --> 20:01.630
Jeez, nobody's coming back to class! I'll get hunk!

20:06.730 --> 20:09.680
<i>Ah, I forgot my textbook again!</i>

20:17.560 --> 20:21.780
Hi-Hirose-kun! Ehm... textbook...

20:27.450 --> 20:32.000
He won't wake up... probably don't have it anyway...

20:38.510 --> 20:39.160
Here.

20:42.080 --> 20:44.930
<i>I'm Nishiyama Hiyori, 15 years old.</i>

20:47.630 --> 20:50.260
<i>And I fell in love!</i>

20:53.270 --> 20:58.230
Hiyo's Love

20:53.270 --> 20:58.230
Translation: Imangascans

20:53.270 --> 20:58.230
Timing: POPGO

20:53.270 --> 20:58.230
Edit: Inactive

20:53.270 --> 20:58.230
Typeset: Vector02

22:28.250 --> 22:30.670
<i>He really does suck at drawing.</i>
